      ⍝ → and A→B: simple coverage of every variant (monadic/dyadic,
      ⍝ literal/label) in every context (defined function, lambda,
      ⍝ immediate execution, ⍎). Each candidate line prints its own
      ⍝ ⎕LC so a branch landing on the wrong line shows up immediately
      ⍝ as a wrong number, rather than needing to be inferred from a
      ⍝ side effect.
      ⍝

      ⍝ dyadic, literal A: relative to the current line, as always
      ⍝
      )ERASE FOO
