      ⍝ a label's value laundered through a variable is no longer a
      ⍝ direct label reference, so it stays relative (not absolute) --
      ⍝ X→1 here is 5 (TARGET's line) relative to line 3, i.e. line 8:
      ⍝ TARGET's own line (5) is never reached.
      ⍝
      )ERASE FOO
